msgid "The token has been deleted."
msgstr "Žeton je izbrisan."

#: src/hrcek/collections/errors.py
msgid "That entry is not yours to collect."
msgstr "Ta vnos ni vaš, da bi ga zbirali."

#: src/hrcek/collections/errors.py
msgid "This collection follows a label, so entries cannot be added by hand."
msgstr "Ta zbirka sledi oznaki, zato vnosov ni mogoče dodajati ročno."

#: src/hrcek/collections/forms.py
msgid "Optional. Anyone who can see this collection sees its description too."
msgstr "Neobvezno. Kdor vidi to zbirko, vidi tudi njen opis."

#: src/hrcek/collections/forms.py
msgid ""
"Choose entries by hand, or let the collection hold everything carrying one "
"label. This cannot be changed afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Izberite vnose ročno ali pustite, da zbirka vsebuje vse z eno oznako. Tega "
"pozneje ni mogoče spremeniti."

#: src/hrcek/collections/forms.py
msgid "Only needed for a collection that follows a label."
msgstr "Potrebno le za zbirko, ki sledi oznaki."

#: src/hrcek/collections/forms.py
msgid ""
"Private — only you can see this collection. There is no address to share. "
"Anyone with the link — anyone who has the link can see this collection and "
"everything you have chosen to show. The link is hard to guess, but it is not "
"a password: whoever you send it to can pass it on. Public — anyone can see "
"this collection, and it can be found by search engines. Its address contains "
"your public name."
msgstr ""
"Zasebno — to zbirko vidite samo vi. Naslova za deljenje ni. Kdor koli s "
"povezavo — kdor koli ima povezavo, vidi to zbirko in vse, kar ste izbrali za "
"prikaz. Povezavo je težko uganiti, a ni geslo: komur koli jo pošljete, jo "
"lahko posreduje naprej. Javno — zbirko vidi kdor koli in jo lahko najdejo "
"iskalniki. Njen naslov vsebuje vaše javno ime."

#: src/hrcek/collections/forms.py
msgid ""
"Shown to everyone who can see the page. Anything you leave unticked stays "
"private."
msgstr ""
"Prikazano vsem, ki vidijo stran. Kar pustite neoznačeno, ostane zasebno."

#: src/hrcek/collections/forms.py
msgid ""
"A picture you show here can be opened by anyone who can see this page, even "
"outside it."
msgstr ""
"Sliko, ki jo pokažete tu, lahko odpre vsak, ki vidi to stran, tudi zunaj nje."

#: src/hrcek/collections/forms.py
msgid ""
"Only the fields you tick are shown. The address and the title of each entry "
"are always shown."
msgstr ""
"Prikazana so le polja, ki jih označite. Naslov in ime vsakega vnosa sta "
"vedno prikazana."

